                                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="accordion5112Header0">                       
                                                <div class="leftside">
                                                    <h4 class="panel-title margin-btm-0">
                                                    <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse0" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" aria-expanded="aria-expanded" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse0" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse0" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                            Timeline and Key Dates
                                                        </a>
                                                    </h4>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="rightside">
                                                <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse0" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" aria-expanded="aria-expanded" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse0" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse0" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                    <i class="fa pull-right"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordion5112Collapse0" class="panel-collapse collapse " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="accordion5112Heading0" aria-expanded="aria-expanded">
                                            <div class="panel-body">

<p><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/2026%20Transmission%20Settlements%20Billing%20Cycle%20Key%20Dates666671.pdf?v=20251212104414">2026 Transmission Settlements Billing Cycle Key Dates</a></p>
<p>Transmission Settlements follows a calendar-month billing cycle during the first five business days of the month. MP and CLF files are used as billing determinants in the charge calculations and must be submitted to MISO by 12:00 p.m. on the 3<sup>rd</sup> business day. Preliminary and final billing statements are available on day 2 and day 5 of the billing cycle.</p>
<p>&nbsp;<strong>Billing Cycle Timeline</strong></p>
