<td style="height: 36.5375px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 36px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Due Date</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 35.4875px;">
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Network Integration Service (NITS) peak load file due</td>
