<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">2nd business day of the month</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 35.4875px;">
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">NITS peak load file due for final settlements</td>
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">3rd business day of the month by 12 p.m. If not received, estimated values will be used.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 35.4875px; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);" data-darkreader-inline-bgcolor="">
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Final settlement distributed (Day 5 run)</td>
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">5th business day of the month</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 35.4875px;">
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Payment due</td>
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Terms are net 7 upon receipt of invoice</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 35.4875px; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250);" data-darkreader-inline-bgcolor="">
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Payments distributed</td>
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">24-48 hours after receipt of payment unless the following day is a Friday, weekend, bank holiday, or MISO observed holiday. In that case, payment is due the next business day.</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 35.4875px;">
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">Last day to enter Transmission Settlements dispute</td>
<td style="height: 35.4875px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(182, 220, 225); font-size: 16px;" data-darkreader-inline-border-top="" data-darkreader-inline-border-right="" data-darkreader-inline-border-bottom="" data-darkreader-inline-border-left="">120 days after date of invoice</td>
</tr>
