                                    </div>
                                    <!-- Accordion View -->
                                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="accordion5112Header1">                       
                                                <div class="leftside">
                                                    <h4 class="panel-title margin-btm-0">
                                                    <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse1" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse1" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse1" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                            Uploading Files
                                                        </a>
                                                    </h4>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="rightside">
                                                <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse1" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse1" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse1" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                    <i class="fa pull-right"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordion5112Collapse1" class="panel-collapse collapse " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="accordion5112Heading1">
                                            <div class="panel-body">

<p>Transmission Owners upload Monthly Peak (MP), Pass Through Billing (SP) and Monthly Load Factor (CLF) files via MISO's Market Portal. Formatting requirements and example .txt files provide guidance on proper file submission. The upload user guide outlines procedures for obtaining access to the portal and for navigating through the application.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Upload User Guide</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/Transmission%20Settlements%20Upload%20User%20Guide%20with%20API462855.pdf">Transmission Settlements Upload User Guide with API</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>SP -- Pass Through Billing</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/SP%20File%20-%20Pass%20Through%20Billing101653.pdf">SP File -- Pass Through Billing</a></li>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/sp000xxxx2016090000est01101654.txt">sp000xxxx2016090000est01.txt&nbsp;</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>MP -- Monthly Peak Load Meter Data</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/MP%20-%20Monthly%20Peak%20Load%20Meter%20Data101661.pdf">MP -- Monthly Peak Load Meter Data</a></li>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/mp001xxx_2017060800CST01101662.txt">mp001xxx_2017060800CST01.txt</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>CLF -- Monthly Load Factor Data</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/CLF%20-%20Monthly%20Load%20Factor%20Data101639.pdf">CLF -- Monthly Load Factor Data</a></li>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/clf001xxxx2016090001101656.txt">clf001xxxx2016090001.txt</a></li>
</ul>                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <!-- Accordion View -->
                                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="accordion5112Header2">                       
                                                <div class="leftside">
                                                    <h4 class="panel-title margin-btm-0">
                                                    <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse2" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse2" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse2" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                            Downloading Statements
                                                        </a>
                                                    </h4>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="rightside">
                                                <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse2" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse2" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse2" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                    <i class="fa pull-right"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordion5112Collapse2" class="panel-collapse collapse " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="accordion5112Heading2">
                                            <div class="panel-body">

<p>Preliminary and final transmission settlements billing statements can be downloaded from MISO&rsquo;s Market Portal. Procedures for obtaining access to the portal and for navigating through the application can be found in the Download User Guide.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Download User Guide</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/Transmission%20Statement%20Download%20User%20Guide119314.pdf">Transmission Statement Download User Guide</a></li>
</ul>
<p>The EIS Specification document provides a means to download transmission settlements statement details into market participants' own settlement systems.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Statement EIS Specification</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/Transmission%20Settlement%20Statement%20EIS%20Specification%20Document120021.pdf">Transmission Settlements Statement EIS Specification Document</a></li>
</ul>
<p>A sample TS statement contains billing scenarios for customers with multiple reservations.&nbsp; Charges are displayed by schedule by reservation in a standard resettlement cadence format (TS0, TS1, TS4, TS8, TS12).&nbsp; Example adjustments are resettled in the TS1.</p>
<p><strong>Sample Transmission Settlements Statement</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/tsCUST202502010000_TS0690992.xlsx"><u>tsCUST202502010000_TS0</u></a></li>
</ul>
<ul></ul>                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <!-- Accordion View -->
                                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="accordion5112Header3">                       
                                                <div class="leftside">
                                                    <h4 class="panel-title margin-btm-0">
                                                    <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse3" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse3" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse3" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                            Charges and Calculations
                                                        </a>
                                                    </h4>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="rightside">
                                                <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse3" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse3" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse3" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                    <i class="fa pull-right"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordion5112Collapse3" class="panel-collapse collapse " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="accordion5112Heading3">
                                            <div class="panel-body">

<p>The type of service taken dictates which schedules will be billed. Transmission Settlements bills based on the SINK of the reservation and uses rates developed for that pricing zone.</p>
<p><strong>Determine which schedules will be billed</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/TS%20Charge%20Matrix642647.xlsx">Transmission Settlements Charge Matrix</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Estimate charges and revenue</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/Transmission%20Settlements%20Charge%20and%20Revenue%20Calculations648686.xlsx?v=20240916095953">Transmission Settlements Charge and Revenue Calculations</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Rate Calculation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://cdn.misoenergy.org/Tariff%20Pricing%20Calculation%20Guide648719.docx?v=20240918091042">Tariff Pricing Calculation Guide</a></li>
</ul>                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <!-- Accordion View -->
                                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                                        <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="accordion5112Header4">                       
                                                <div class="leftside">
                                                    <h4 class="panel-title margin-btm-0">
                                                    <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse4" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse4" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse4" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                            Billing Disputes
                                                        </a>
                                                    </h4>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="rightside">
                                                <a data-toggle="collapse" href="#accordion5112Collapse4" data-parent="#accordion5112" role="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordion5112Collapse4" aria-controls="accordion5112Collapse4" class="accordion-link blue collapsed">
                                                    <i class="fa pull-right"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div id="accordion5112Collapse4" class="panel-collapse collapse " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="accordion5112Heading4">
                                            <div class="panel-body">

<p>The Transmission Settlements dispute resolution process exists to resolve disputes between the Transmission Customer/Owner and MISO on an invoice or Open Invoice Status Report (OISR). Charge disputes can cover calculation methodology or billing determinant data. Revenue disputes can cover the revenue distribution methodology. Disputes must be submitted no later than 120 days from date of invoice to be considered for further evaluation.</p>
<p>Initiate a dispute through the<a href="https://help.misoenergy.org/"> Help Center.</a></p>                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div></div>
</div>

    
